# Slides Marp — só entra no Git o toolchain (scripts, tema, componentes, template).
# Por aula/deck (local): copiar registry.example.json → registry.json, preencher `decks`, criar sources/<id>/.
# Gerar: npm run slides:build -- <deckId>  |  npm run slides:build -- --all
tools/slides/decks/_generated/
tools/slides/decks/*.md
!tools/slides/decks/TEMPLATE.md
